flowchart TD
    A[Expense transactions<br/>from PostgreSQL] --> B[Exclude Income]
    B --> C[Aggregate by calendar month]
    C --> D[Sort chronologically +<br/>fill missing months with 0]
    D --> E{Enough months?<br/>seqLen+1+val+test}
    E -- No --> ERR[Explainable insufficient-data<br/>response + demo option]
    E -- Yes --> F[Chronological split<br/>train / val / test]
    F --> G[Fit MinMaxScaler<br/>on TRAIN months only]
    G --> H[Transform full series<br/>with fitted scaler]
    H --> I[Sliding-window sequences<br/>window = previous 6 months]
    I --> J[Train LSTM model]

    subgraph Model architecture
      J --> J1[LSTM 64 units]
      J1 --> J2[Dropout 0.2]
      J2 --> J3[Dense 32, ReLU]
      J3 --> J4[Dense 1 output]
    end

    J4 --> K[Optimizer: Adam<br/>Loss: MSE<br/>EarlyStopping on val_loss, patience 10]
    K --> L[Evaluate on unseen test targets<br/>MAE / RMSE / MAPE]
    L --> M[Compare vs baselines:<br/>naive last-month + 3-month moving average]
    M --> N[Persist artifacts:<br/>model.json + weights.bin<br/>scaler.json / meta.json / eval.json]
    M --> O[Record model_runs + predictions<br/>in PostgreSQL]
    H --> P[predictNext:<br/>latest 6-month window]
    N --> P
    P --> Q[Inverse-transform scaled output<br/>clamp to >= 0]
    Q --> R[Next-calendar-month forecast<br/>shown on Dashboard / Prediction / Reports<br/>never mixed with ACTUAL expenditure]
